WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.050
A real booking in Altobay: brake repair on a 2021 Kia.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.238
The mechanic picks Wheel and Tire, takes three photos,

00:00:09.238 --> 00:00:10.970
and taps Create AI report.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.790
No judgments, just photos.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.190
The photos go to the vision model.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.854
It writes down what it can see:

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:24.510
corrosion on the rotor, dust and oxidation on the caliper,

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.270
rust on the studs, a shock that's intact.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.650
About thirty seconds.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.270
Each item is read on its own.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.247
Brake pads have a before-and-after pair,

00:00:37.247 --> 00:00:38.350
so they're compared.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.630
The battery has no photo, so that call stays with the mechanic.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.150
The report drafts itself.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.490
Now the mechanic checks it over.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:53.086
The customer note is rewritten in their own words,

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.410
each call is confirmed: fixed, or watch,

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.290
and the report is sent.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.470
The mechanic decides, not the AI.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.936
On the customer's phone: a notification,

00:01:07.936 --> 00:01:11.150
the booking, the report, and all four photos.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.090
One tap opens the full report.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.830
The full report.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.747
What was serviced today, what to watch,

00:01:22.747 --> 00:01:24.110
and what wasn't assessed.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.044
Tap an item and it opens up:

00:01:27.044 --> 00:01:30.370
every photo, before and after, with a caption.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.370
What the part is, in plain words.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.670
What the mechanic said.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.838
And what happens next:

00:01:37.838 --> 00:01:40.650
the part, the cost, and how it was checked.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.450
On the car, every area we checked is marked.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.481
Costs list parts and labor separately,

00:01:48.481 --> 00:01:49.898
with tax on parts only:

00:01:49.898 --> 00:01:51.870
that's what California requires.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.490
The battery test is quoted, not pushed.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.664
And the warranty terms are spelled out,

00:01:59.664 --> 00:02:01.290
so nothing is left to guess.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.910
One real booking, start to finish.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.450
This is Altobay.
